    "html": "<blockquote>\n        <p>If you are <i>new</i> to the sport or looking for\n        introductory information, first see the following\n        articles; they will cover almost any questions you might\n        have.<br>\n        <br>\n        <a href=\"getinto.htm\">Get into Bullseye\n        Shooting</a> by Sherwood Veith,\n        from <i>Handgunning</i><br>\n        <a href=\"bullseye.htm\">Bullseye\n        Shooting</a> by Charles E. Petty,\n        from the <i>American Rifleman</i><br>\n        </p>\n    </blockquote>\n    <hr width=\"90%\">\n\n    <ul>\n<li>Accuracy Issues With Dot Sights: <a href=\"dotsight.htm\">by John Dreyer</a></li>\n<li>Accurize a .45 Pistol, Custom Guns: <a href=\"cstomgun.htm\">by Larry Leutenegger</a></li>\n<li>Adjusting Sights: <a href=\"chapter4.htm#properzero\">from USAMU</a></li>\n<li>Air Pistol: <a href=\"other.htm\">Information About the Sport</a></li>\n<li>Alcohol, Adverse Effects: <a href=\"chapter10.htm\">from the USAMU</a></li>\n<li>Alibis In Sustained Fire: <a href=\"http://www.nrahq.org/compete/RuleBooks/Pistol/pst-w10.pdf\">from Rulebook</a>, or <a href=\"malfunction.htm\">Common Causes</a></li>\n<li>Ammunition, Ammo: <a href=\"equipmnt.htm#ammo\">Selecting .22 Ammo</a>, or <a href=\"reloads.htm\">Reloading Information</a></li>\n<li>Analyzing Group Placement: <a href=\"training.htm\">from USAMU</a></li>\n<li>Arc of Movement, Reducing: <a href=\"chapter1.htm\">from USAMU</a>,  or <a href=\"billblnk.htm#still\">by Bill Blankenship</a></li>\n<li>Army Marksmanship Unit: <a href=\"amucover.htm\">Actual Training Guide</a></li>\n<li>Artificial Group Tighteners: <a href=\"chapter10.htm\">from the USAMU</a>, or from <a href=\"joewhite.htm\">Joe White</a></li>\n<li>Bad Habits of Shooters: <a href=\"training.htm\">from USAMU</a></li>\n<li>Bad Shots, Analyzing: <a href=\"training.htm\">from USAMU</a></li>\n<li>Blankenship, Bill: <a href=\"billblnk.htm\">Writings of the Champion</a></li>\n<li>Brass, Components for Reloading: <a href=\"reloads.htm\">General Information</a></li>\n<li>Breath Control, Breathing: <a href=\"billblnk.htm#breath\">by Bill Blankenship</a>, or <a href=\"chapter1.htm#breath\">from USAMU</a></li>\n<li>Bullets, Components for Reloading: <a href=\"reloads.htm\">General Information</a></li>\n<li>Caffeine, Adverse Effects (Coffee): <a href=\"chapter10.htm\">from the USAMU</a></li>\n<li>Camp Perry, Lodging and Dining: <a href=\"perinfo.htm\">compiled by John Dreyer</a></li>\n<li>Camp Perry, Ohio: <a href=\"perryfaq.htm\">by Justin Nystrom</a></li>\n<li>Carrying Cases, Pistol Boxes: <a href=\"equipmnt.htm#box\">by John Dreyer</a></li>\n<li>Cartes, David: <a href=\"rapdfire.htm\">Writings of the Champion</a></li>\n<li>Charts, for Analyzing Shots: <a href=\"training.htm\">from USAMU</a></li>\n<li>Checklist, Preparation on Firing Line: <a href=\"chapter4.htm#checklist\">from USAMU</a></li>\n<li>Classification System: <a href=\"http://www.nrahq.org/compete/RuleBooks/Pistol/pst-w19.pdf\">from Rulebook</a></li>\n<li>Cleaning, Firearms: <a href=\"equipmnt.htm#supplies\">by John Dreyer</a></li>\n<li>Confidence:  <a href=\"joyner.htm#mental\">by William Joyner</a>, or <a href=\"joewhite.htm\">by Joe White</a></li>\n<li>Courses of Fire: <a href=\"http://www.nrahq.org/compete/RuleBooks/Pistol/pst-w07.pdf\">from Rulebook</a></li>\n<li>Cowboy Action Shooting, SASS : <a href=\"other.htm\">Information on the Sport</a></li>\n<li>Crossfires: <a href=\"http://www.nrahq.org/compete/RuleBooks/Pistol/pst-w14.pdf\">from Rulebook</a></li>\n<li>Derr, Greg: <a href=\"gregderr.htm\">Writings of the Champion</a></li>\n<li>Diet and Health: <a href=\"chapter9.htm\">from USAMU</a></li>\n<li>Dot Sights: <a href=\"dotsight.htm\">by John Dreyer</a></li>\n<li>Dreyer, John: <a href=\"why.htm\">Purpose of These Efforts</a>, or <a href=\"mailto:jd@bullseyepistol.com\">Contact Him by Email</a></li>\n<li>Dry Firing: <a href=\"fulford.htm#practice\">by Allen Fulford</a></li>\n<li>Ear Protection/Eye Protection: <a href=\"equipmnt.htm#ears\">by John Dreyer</a></li>\n<li>Electronic Mailing List: <a href=\"bulseyel.htm\">for Paul Perrone</a></li>\n<li>Equipment - Cost Justifying: <a href=\"pafford.htm\">by Randy Pafford</a></li>\n<li>Equipment Requirements: <a href=\"equipmnt.htm\">by John Dreyer</a></li>\n<li>Equipment, Sources: <a href=\"links.htm#products\">Various Links</a></li>\n<li>Errors, Common: <a href=\"training.htm\">from USAMU</a></li>\n<li>Etiquette: <a href=\"nratips.htm\">from the NRA</a></li>\n<li>Exercise Programs: <a href=\"chapter8.htm\">from USAMU</a>, or <a href=\"stamina.htm\">by John Dreyer</a></li>\n<li>Fulford, Allen: <a href=\"fulford.htm\">Writings of the Late Champion</a></li>\n<li>Fung, Randall: <a href=\"goodgrip.htm\">His Products &amp; Contacting the Craftsman</a></li>\n<li>Glossary of Shooting Terms: <a href=\"glossary.htm\">from USAMU</a></li>\n<li>Grip, Proper: <a href=\"billblnk.htm#grip\">by Bill Blankenship</a>, or <a href=\"chapter1.htm#grip\">from USAMU</a></li>\n<li>Grips, Anatomical: <a href=\"goodgrip.htm\">by John Dreyer</a></li>\n<li>Groups, Analyzing Placement: <a href=\"training.htm\">from USAMU</a></li>\n<li>Hardball Pistol: <a href=\"http://www.nrahq.org/compete/RuleBooks/Pistol/pst-w03.pdf\">from Rulebook</a>, or <a href=\"dcm.htm\">from DCM Pamphlet</a>, or <a href=\"reloads.htm\">from <i>American Rifleman</i></a></li>\n<li>International Shooting, ISSF, UIT: <a href=\"other.htm\">Information on the Sport</a></li>\n<li>Internet Mailing List: <a href=\"bulseyel.htm\">the Bullseye-L forum</a></li>\n<li>Internet Resources, Links: <a href=\"links.htm\">Links to Other Sites</a></li>\n<li>Jerking The Trigger: <a href=\"chapter3.htm\">by USAMU</a></li>\n<li>Joyner, William: <a href=\"joyner.htm\">Writings of the Champion</a></li>\n<li>Leg Match: <a href=\"http://www.nrahq.org/compete/RuleBooks/Pistol/pst-w01.pdf\">General Definition</a>, or <a href=\"dcm.htm\">Service Pistol Definition</a></li>\n<li>Leutenegger, Larry: <a href=\"